    "CONTESTED if at least one required check passed and at least one failed.",
    "REJECTED if a required check failed and none passed.",
    "CANDIDATE if no required check has passed yet (and none failed).",
    "PARTIALLY_VERIFIED if some required checks passed, none failed and some are pending.",
    "VERIFIED if every required check passed."
